{"kind":"event","event_id":9016,"event_uid":"01M2Q3YP1VTTPG44QTD7JJCNRE","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":372,"issue_uid":"01M2Q3ST38J7PYGVM1R5KTMK1Y","issue_short_id":"mk1y","actor":"exam:2@run-31","hlc_physical_ms":1789629782075,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"9f028a1ec981e7abf6d603f5cd68ac6a803fd208091d1e99c9d57259a40564d7","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2Q3YP1SM28EMJJ7FW63RC4N","author":"exam:2@run-31","body":"examiner (task 2): writing client/test/sync-origin.test.ts against the five Machine clauses, one test block per Proof leg, following client/test/exam-page.test.ts's shape exactly (happy-dom registrator, mock.module on reconnecting-websocket + ../src/sqlite + both TinyBase link factories, dynamic imports after the mocks, 300ms settle, drained afterAll). Leg (a) calls readSyncOrigin() from ../src/storeData over the six cases plus the globalThis.window-replaced-by-undefined case (descriptor saved and restored). Leg (b) calls syncUrl('todos') from ../src/config for handle-set and handle-unset, then renders unseeded+unflagged with __TINYAPP_SYNC__ set and asserts the recording socket stub took exactly one URL, equal to 'ws://127.0.0.1:4321/sync/todos'. Leg (c) asserts window.__TINYAPP_STORE__ is the Provider's store by identity and by full getContent() equality after setTodoCompleted, with persister and synchronizer stubs constructed once each. Leg (d) is three renders (no handle / seed / exam flag) with exact socket counts and URLs. Leg (e) reads AGENTS.md's ## Key Files section up to ## Working Method and applies the first Run: line's ordering as a regex. The two static Run: lines (vite-env.d.ts declaration, SERVER unchanged) get one assertion each so M1 and M2 are covered whole. Expected red at BASE: readSyncOrigin/syncUrl absent, the handle ignored, AGENTS.md silent.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:23:02.073681644Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:23:02.075Z"}
{"kind":"event","event_id":9017,"event_uid":"01M2Q406CXYCBGQKBM1DX1G2YP","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":371,"issue_uid":"01M2Q3SPJ2BRYGQE46G1CG1BTD","issue_short_id":"1btd","actor":"impl:1@run-31","hlc_physical_ms":1789629831581,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"44adc28251bfafc2fced8cd24677d45e1c583772a6c913c7ae12735a613bedfa","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2Q406CW45961PT584HVKVNH","author":"impl:1@run-31","body":"Approach: lift server/test/celld.ts into packages/tinyapp-exam/src/celld.ts behaviour-for-behaviour, adding the three things M1/M2 name that BASE lacks — a `serverDir` option (the copy source, whose parent is the workspace root for the node_modules symlink and CELLD_ESBUILD), `port` on the resolved object, a `budgetMb` option behind CELLD_MAX_RSS_MB (default 512), and a real rejection naming `readyMs` when the readiness poll runs out (BASE falls out of its while loop and resolves anyway). New src/surface.ts holds examSurface(url) over the root's six verbs plus a generic `call(verb, query)` the Proof's leg (d) names. index.ts re-exports both. server/test/celld.ts is deleted and the two server tests re-point their import to 'tinyapp-exam', keeping the child-process case form untouched.\n\nEnvironment note up front: there is no celld binary in this sandbox (no /usr/local/bin/celld, Bun.which('celld') is null), so `bun test server/test/exam-surface.test.ts server/test/recorder.test.ts` is red at BASE too — it throws 'celld: no binary' out of beforeAll. I will verify the lifecycle legs against stub binaries written outside the tree and report the missing binary as a concern.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:23:51.580335857Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:23:51.581Z"}
{"kind":"event","event_id":9018,"event_uid":"01M2Q41CN7QPMSXCYP47A0WBQZ","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":372,"issue_uid":"01M2Q3ST38J7PYGVM1R5KTMK1Y","issue_short_id":"mk1y","actor":"impl:2@run-31","hlc_physical_ms":1789629870759,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"6f15f10a052ba17bb208b33e1e3a86322e8e8947b07f5fced75078acdc916513","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2Q41CN5CD658JE0RAH2N66V","author":"impl:2@run-31","body":"Landed as ef6d600..HEAD across the five source files (the exam file is the peer's).\n\nDecisions a later session would otherwise rediscover:\n\n- `readSyncOrigin` lives in `client/src/storeData.ts` and `config.ts` imports it, not the other way round — `storeData.ts` imports nothing from `config.ts`, so there is no cycle. `syncUrl(module)` is `${readSyncOrigin() ?? SERVER}/sync/${module}`, so `SERVER` stays the single spelling of the built-in origin and the `/sync/<module>` path is written once.\n- The handle is accepted only as a string starting `ws://` or `wss://`; `''`, `42` and `http://…` all read as no handle, and `typeof window === 'undefined'` short-circuits first so the Bun-side call (the linter's capture child) gets `undefined`.\n- The exposure condition in `createTodosStore` is the BASE one with a third disjunct: `seed === undefined && !readExamFlag() && readSyncOrigin() === undefined ? undefined : created`. That keeps the clear-a-stale-handle behaviour intact for a plain page.\n- `SyncLink` reads `syncUrl('todos')` once inside the `useCreateSynchronizer` factory; the exam flag still short-circuits the whole child, so a flagged page constructs no socket.\n\nVerified all five legs with a throwaway happy-dom render harness modelled on `client/test/exam-page.test.ts` (socket/persister/synchronizer stubs counted, URLs captured); it was deleted before the commit. Handle set + unseeded + unflagged: exactly one socket at `ws://127.0.0.1:4321/sync/todos`, one persister, one synchronizer, `__TINYAPP_STORE__` identical to the Provider's store and following it through `setTodoCompleted`. No handle: one socket at `ws://localhost:9876/sync/todos`, `__TINYAPP_STORE__` undefined. Seeded and flagged: zero sockets.\n\n`bun run typecheck`, `bun run lint:state` (0 findings) and `bun run lint:ui` are clean; the two frozen-path `git diff --quiet` checks hold.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:24:30.757998502Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:24:30.759Z"}
